==Trivia==
*The Small Medals look similar to the [[wikipedia:Dragon Quest|''Dragon Quest'']] series' [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Mini_medal Mini medals], while [[Medal King (Special Cat)|Medal King]]'s name, description and design reference the [https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Medal_King Medal Kings], particularly Medford from ''[https://dragon-quest.org/wiki/Dragon_Quest_VI:_Realms_of_Revelation Dragon Quest VI: Realms of Revelation]''. The Small Medals and Mini medals' names are also more similar in Japanese, with the former being 伝説のちいさいメダル ''Densetsu no Chiisai Medaru'' and the latter ちいさなメダル ''Chiisana Medaru''.

